---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy | Seniors Helping Seniors® Southern Utah">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-6 bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#3b5998]">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mt-2">Effective Date: February 3, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 border border-neutral-200">
    <h2>What Personal Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information you provide directly, such as your name, contact details, and any information submitted through our contact form. We may also collect technical data such as IP address, browser type, and device information.</p>
    <h2>How Data Is Collected</h2>
    <p>Data is collected when you fill out forms, contact us, or interact with our website. We may use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience and analyze site usage.</p>
    <h2>How Data Is Used</h2>
    <p>Your data is used to respond to inquiries, provide services, improve our website, and comply with legal obligations. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p>We use cookies to remember preferences and gather analytics. You may disable cookies in your browser settings, but some features may not function properly.</p>
    <h2>Data Storage, Security, and Handling</h2>
    <p>We implement security measures to protect your data. Information is stored securely and only accessible to authorized personnel.</p>
    <h2>User Rights</h2>
    <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. You may also opt out of communications at any time.</p>
    <h2>SMS Messaging Privacy</h2>
    <p>If you opt in to receive SMS messages from Seniors Helping Seniors, your consent is used solely for the purpose of delivering the messages you have agreed to receive. We do not sell, rent, or share your SMS opt-in information or phone number with third parties for their own marketing purposes.</p>
    <p>We may share your information with trusted service providers solely to deliver our text messages (such as messaging platforms and carriers), and only as necessary to provide this service.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@southernutahshs.com">info@southernutahshs.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Fragment slot="footer">
    <Footer />
  </Fragment>
</MainLayout>
